{"name":"Donate Your Gift","dev":"Chandrakant Gopalan","keys":["ios:6760786102"],"ios":{"id":"6760786102","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/donate-your-gift/id6760786102?uo=4","rating":5,"ratings":2,"price":"Free","genre":"Lifestyle","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/89/b0/97/89b097d3-b16c-c97a-da4e-c8cf39afdb27/dyg11.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/30/65/c6/3065c6e8-9395-4ff2-629d-3b8bccf4a878/dyg12.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/c5/b2/cb/c5b2cb49-7977-dd70-fb0e-e7d6ab0641b8/dyg13.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/54/9d/05/549d0526-194b-9923-0b28-62a477766606/dyg14.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/89/86/1c/89861c04-b14d-dca8-de96-e1858bffad94/dyg15.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/02/c4/a0/02c4a0cc-8fcb-7598-707b-52db59e686db/dyg16.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/09/4c/af/094caf1d-8205-3d81-501c-72cbd4d45bcd/dyg17.png/320x480bb.jpg"],"desc":"Donate Your Gift allows you to ask for donations to your favorite charities from family members and friends for your birthday or any another gift-giving occasion rather than getting gifts. You can maintain your list of charities and selectively send them to your donors via text or email. You can also categorize your charities under groups and send only a specific group to your donors.","released":"2026-03-31","updated":"2026-03-31","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/f3/88/9b/f3889b35-6a81-be39-485e-814ee1436787/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-11-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/f3/88/9b/f3889b35-6a81-be39-485e-814ee1436787/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-11-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Lifestyle","rating":5.0,"ratings":2,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":0,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":0,"self_n":1,"hn_score":0,"first":1776053545,"last":1776053545,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":0,"pos_pct":null,"neg_pct":null,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":47747510,"k":"ios:6760786102","type":"comment","by":"cgopalan","time":1776053545,"text":"For occasions like birthdays or Christmas where people want to give you gifts, I have always wanted to ask them to make donations to charities of my choosing instead. So I built an app to enable this: https://apps.apple.com/ca/app/donate-your-gift/id6760786102\nIt is very simple but I didn't find anything quite singly-focused like it, so I built it just to scratch my own itch.","title":null,"story_id":47741527,"story_title":"Ask HN: What Are You Working On? (April 2026)","story_score":347,"comments":0,"w":0,"u":-1,"s":"pos","self":true}],"slug":"donate-your-gift"}